## 5. Open-Source Projects Deep Dive

### 5.1 jthomperoo/predictive-horizontal-pod-autoscaler

This is the most mature open-source predictive HPA. Architecture:

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│         predictive-horizontal-pod-autoscaler  │
│                                              │
│  Models supported:                           │
│  - Linear Regression                         │
│  - Holt-Winters (triple exponential smoothing)│
│  - Seasonal Naive                            │
│                                              │
│  Config via ConfigMap:                       │
│  - Lookback window (history length)          │
│  - Prediction horizon                        │
│  - Model hyperparameters                     │
│  - Stored in CRD: PredictiveHorizontalPodAutoscaler │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

